<div class="key">
  <div><span class="tag" style="color:%(mi)s;background:%(mw)s">measured</span>
       somebody surveyed it and this is what they found.</div>
  <div><span class="tag" style="color:%(di)s;background:%(dw)s">derived</span>
       arithmetic on something real. Reproducible, not observed.</div>
  <div><span class="tag" style="color:%(ci)s;background:%(cw)s">chosen</span>
       a person decided. The reasoning is beside it.</div>
</div>

